I implemented the node, but not the two operations additions. This node's only capability is `Clock`, so its world has no filesystem and no network import. A log file at `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and a fetch from `metadata.internal.example` can't be reached from the component. Adding either would mean granting the node new authority (an HTTP or filesystem capability) in the graph, which is a design decision for the graph owners. The output is unaffected.

